ng tile, preserves the potential for a Pung of W3 (2 points), and avoids giving others a chance to use the Dragon tile. Keeping T9 pair and W3 Pung aligns with patterns like All Terminals or Outside Hand, which can contribute to higher scoring combinations.\nAnswer: Play J2"}
