ucial for scoring patterns like Pure Straight or Pure Shifted Chows.]\\nReason: [By discarding W5, the player retains flexibility to form consecutive chows in the Character suit, which are high-value patterns. Keeping an extra W5 might limit the ability to create multiple chows, while discarding it allows for cleaner sequence formation.]\\nAnswer: Play W5\"}"}
